  "behavior": {
    "before": "With layer grouping disabled, a 2D LINE and a 3D POLYFACE on an off layer imported visibly and produced no unsupported-feature report.",
    "after": "Before discarding the resolved layer pointer, the importer reports Off-layer visibility without layer grouping for each affected entity. An unused off layer alone does not trigger a report. Geometry still imports and is visible: this is a diagnostic, not visibility preservation."
  },
